Para. 4 — Repealed by No I of the O of 29 Sept. 2023, with effect from 1 Jan. 2024 (AS 2023 581).
|

:INFO
Art. 17e Reference year
The reference year is the calendar year in which achievement of the individual target is verified.
|

:NOTE
Art. 17e — Originally Art. 17a, then Art. 17abis. Inserted by No I of the O of 25 Nov. 2020 (AS 2020 6081) and amended by No I of the O of 29 Sept. 2023, in force since 1 Jan. 2024 (AS 2023 581).
|

:INFO
Art. 17f
